* @title REPLACE performs character-for-character substitution
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Appendix D, Solution 1.4
* @input >>>
* ABC XYZ 012
* HELLO, WORLD!
* <<<
* @expect >>>
* 012MIJKMSTU
* 74--%LMH%C-3Q
* <<<
          &TRIM = 1
          IN = 'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ, .:;!?0123456789+-*/%'
          CODE = '0123456789+-*/%ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ, .:;!?'
READ      LINE = INPUT :F(END)
          OUTPUT = REPLACE(LINE,IN,CODE) :(READ)
END
